-- title:
--   Completion of an étale algebra is widehatR[T]/(f)
-- statement:
--   Let $R_0$ be a Noetherian commutative ring and $B$ an étale $R_0$-algebra (both in the same universe), let $P \subset R_0$ be a maximal ideal and $q \subset B$ a maximal ideal lying over $P$. Let $\alpha \in B/q$ generate $B/q$ as an algebra over $R_0/P$, i.e. $\mathrm{adjoin}_{R_0/P}\{\alpha\} = \top$, and let $f$ be a monic polynomial over the $P$-adic completion $\widehat{R_0} =$ `AdicCompletion P R₀` whose image under the map $\widehat{R_0} \to R_0/P \to B/q$ (reduction at the first level of the completion, `AdicCompletion.evalOneₐ`, followed by the residue extension) equals the image in $(B/q)[T]$ of the minimal polynomial of $\alpha$ over $R_0/P$. The assertion is that there exists a ring homomorphism $\varphi : \widehat{R_0} \to \widehat{B} =$ `AdicCompletion q B` such that (i) $\varphi$ composed with the canonical map $R_0 \to \widehat{R_0}$ agrees with $R_0 \to B \to \widehat{B}$; (ii) the ideal generated by $\varphi$ of the extension $P\widehat{R_0}$ is the extension $q\widehat{B}$; and (iii) there is a ring isomorphism $e : \widehat{R_0}[T]/(f) \xrightarrow{\sim} \widehat{B}$ which is compatible with $\varphi$ on the coefficient ring, $e(\iota(r)) = \varphi(r)$ for all $r \in \widehat{R_0}$, and for which some $b \in B$ satisfies $b \bmod q = \alpha$ and $e(T) - b \in q\widehat{B}$.
--
--   This is the local structure theory of étale algebras after completion: the $q$-adic completion of an étale $R_0$-algebra is the standard étale extension of the $P$-adic completion of $R_0$ cut out by a monic lift of the minimal polynomial of a generator of the residue field extension $B/q$ over $R_0/P$, and the extension is unramified in the strong sense that $P\widehat{R_0}$ generates $q\widehat{B}$. It is used in the computation of the adic completions of the stalks of an integral model of a modular curve at a crossing point, via [`ModularCurve.XOneP.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_uvCrossingModel_unramified_of_primeToP_levelRaise_twoChartIntegralModel_x1_mul`](thm.html#ModularCurve.XOneP.exists_ringEquiv_adicCompletion_stalk_uvCrossingModel_unramified_of_primeToP_levelRaise_twoChartIntegralModel_x1_mul).
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AdicCompletion_exists_ringHom_ringEquiv_adjoinRoot_of_etale_of_isMaximal.lean

